[ceiling] Unavoidable lifting interfaces: these Z29.25 flats retain the finger bearings, R6 end returns and 12 mm handhold roofs. Support can leave through the downward/outward openings and empty seam before assembly. Actual cleanup, bare-surface comfort and loaded lifting remain unqualified.
alternatives: Sloping changes the finger bearing and opening. Filling beneath it blocks upward entry; retain the named lifting profile.
