[ceiling] Unavoidable interleaved screw-bearing ends: these Z102.15 flats retain the complete block lengths and positive running/support room to the neighboring blocks. Support is accessible through the empty seam and interior before assembly; removal effort remains unqualified.
alternatives: A corbel enters the adjacent block envelope. Sloping or shortening spends the defined screw-bearing length; a continuous post prevents interleaving.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/enclosure/enclosure-back-bottom.step
