[ceiling] Unavoidable washer bearings: these Z37.25 flats seat the two lower M5 washers in the inward-open head pockets and retain their full native annular backing. Support leaves through the empty pocket and handhold before hardware placement. Geometric access does not qualify cleanup or washer-handling ease.
alternatives: Sloping tilts a flat washer. Moving the floor changes seating and engagement; closing the inward access obstructs hardware placement.
file: hardware/printed-parts/enclosure/enclosure/enclosure-back-bottom.step
